+
+### [Medium] Oversized UI files are acting as orchestration layers
+- Location: `components/UI/PropertiesPanel.tsx` (1323 LOC), `components/UI/SurfaceProperties.tsx` (981 LOC), `components/UI/Toolbar.tsx` (284 LOC)
